Rāvaṇa sees fallen Jaṭāyu fluttering near hut --- Sītā laments over stricken vulture kinsman --- Rāvaṇa seizes Sītā hair dragging past trees --- Darkness shrouds worlds at outrage --- Brahmā declares deed accomplished as seers react --- Sītā shines like lightning shedding blossoms --- Anklet necklace and jewels shower earth --- Sun dims beasts birds and mountains mourn